# Persistent pager behavior, independent of generated themes and shell startup.
# Keep inherited flags and terminate any prompt with less's option delimiter ($).
# Set features explicitly: repeating --mouse toggles them off in less 702+.
# Older builds retain the shell default. Use --emouse=- on the command line to opt out.
#env
#version >= 702 LESS = ${LESS}$ --emouse=vmove,click
